"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[31538],{31538:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/bc549c5b9b92691ff1be3f71120debd1.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Stone Plate\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Korean Food\\"\\n  address=\\"24, Hangang-daero 53-gil, Yongsan-gu, Seoul\\"\\n  rating=4.0\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Ordered\\n\\n```menu\\n{\\n\\"title\\": \\"Salt-Grilled Eel\\",\\n\\"rating\\": 4.0\\n}\\n---\\nSoft and tender eel rather than crispy. It came pre-grilled, making it very convenient to eat.\\n```\\n```menu\\n{\\n\\"title\\": \\"Perilla Oil Makguksu\\",\\n\\"rating\\": 3.0\\n}\\n---\\nMild and subtle in flavor. It would have been even better with a bit more perilla seeds.\\n```\\n\\n## Review\\n\\nI went on an outing to Seoul after a long time.  \\nHearing that there was a `Minumsa` pop-up store in Yongsan, we headed to Yongsan early.  \\nAfter registering on-site for the pop-up store, we decided to look for a restaurant nearby.  \\n\\nThere were many appetizing spots nearby.  \\nAmong them, we picked <mark>eel</mark>, a dish we don\'t usually eat often.  \\nSeeing good reviews online, we decided to go without hesitation.  \\n\\nReservations for our desired time slot were already full.  \\nWe visited the restaurant with some worry.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nAs expected, we were briefly disheartened when told there were no seats available because we hadn\'t made a reservation.  \\nFortunately, the staff said that if we could finish dining within one hour, we could take a seat, allowing us to barely get in.  \\nWe don\'t really drink alcohol and don\'t eat slowly, so one hour was more than enough.  \\n\\nSince it was a dish requiring cooking time, we first ordered 2 servings of `Salt-Grilled Eel`.  \\nOnly then were we guided to our table.  \\nSince we only had one hour, we immediately placed an additional order for `Perilla Oil Makguksu` right away.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nAfter waiting anxiously for about 20 minutes, the pre-grilled eel was neatly served.  \\nNot having to grill it ourselves at the table was great, allowing us to eat cleanly and comfortably even in the hot weather.  \\n\\nThe `Eel` had a soft and tender texture rather than being crispy.  \\nThe accompanying mushrooms and vegetables were also delicious.  \\nIn particular, there were plenty of mushrooms, and eating just the mushrooms tasted as savory as meat, which was very impressive.  \\n```adcard\\n```\\nNot long after, the `Perilla Oil Makguksu` came out as well.  \\nWe were able to enjoy it alongside the eel.  \\n\\nHaving eaten `Perilla Oil Makguksu` at so many places before, I couldn\'t help comparing it.  \\nThe taste was fairly standard and subtly mild.  \\nIt wasn\'t bad for our palate, but I wished there had been slightly more perilla seeds.  \\n\\nOverall, it was a restaurant where you could enjoy a healthy, wholesome meal.  \\nBecause they use domestic sea eel, the price was a bit high relative to the portion size.  \\nStill, it wasn\'t an unaffordable price.  \\nNext time, it would be good to order an extra single serving as well.  \\n\\n## Pictures\\n\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/bc549c5b9b92691ff1be3f71120debd1.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Stone Plate\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/14971221d25bdefde8e0abc58b8f28a3.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Stone Plate\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/641f7c9fdb0070353baa93bbc02fd84d.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Stone Plate\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/1ada1131f85e3f3dab1c15f35f0bc811.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Stone Plate\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/cb890df2b28a7e13304eae5209ce6c4e.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Stone Plate\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);